WEBVTT

00:10:29.204 --> 00:10:30.871
Rekao je: “Pa ispalo je ovo...”

00:10:30.912 --> 00:10:32.787
Povikao sam, “Stani, stani, stani!

00:10:33.162 --> 00:10:34.537
Vidim, to je otok.”

00:10:35.787 --> 00:10:37.621
Upravo nevjerojatno.

00:10:37.704 --> 00:10:38.912
Dakle, Brownovo gibanje,

00:10:38.996 --> 00:10:42.829
koje ima hrapavost broja dva, ide uokolo.

00:10:42.954 --> 00:10:45.246
Izmjerio sam ga, 1,33.

00:10:45.579 --> 00:10:47.121
Opet, i opet, i opet.

00:10:47.246 --> 00:10:50.787
Duga mjerenja, 
velika Brownova gibanja, 1,33.

00:10:51.204 --> 00:10:53.621
Matematički problem: kako to dokazati?

00:10:54.162 --> 00:10:56.329
Mojim je prijateljima trebalo 20 godina.

00:10:56.662 --> 00:10:59.871
Trojica su imala nepotpune dokaze.